      "text": "If there is tape, keep the area dry until three days after surgery. Do not clean the incision before that time. If there is no tape, clean the edges of the incision gently twice a day. Use a mix of equal parts hydrogen peroxide and distilled water. Then apply an over-the-counter antibiotic ointment, such as bacitracin."
    }
  ],
